dth: 414px)\"><img  data-default-src=\"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2025/0914/r1545239_1296x729_16-9.jpg\"  class=\" lazyload\" data-image-container=\".feed-item-figure\" ></picture></a></div><span class=\"credit\">Photo by Chris Unger/TKO Worldwide LLC via Getty Images</span></figure></li><li class=\"text-container\" data-id=\"12508267\"><h2><a name=\"&lpos=hp-rightrail:story:12508267:10\" href=\"/boxing/story/_/id/12508267/boxing-schedule\">Boxing schedule</a></h2><p>Want to know what fights are on the horizon? Check out the boxing schedule.</p></li></ul> <!-- close content --></article><article class=\"sub-module editorial\"><header class=\"\"><h2 class=\"\">Trending Now</h2></header><ul class=\"content\"><li><figure class=\"feed-item-figure \"><div class=\"img-wrap\"><a name=\"&lpos=hp-rightrail:image:11\" href=\"/mlb/story/_/id/49603685/mlb-lockout-strike-work-stoppage-lessons-learned-kurkjian\" data-sport=\"null\" data-mptype=\"image\"><picture ><source data-srcset=\"https://a2.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0811%2Fr1700455_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=78&h=78&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=center, https://a2.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0811%2Fr1700455_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=156&h=156&scale=crop&cquality=40&location=center 2x\" media=\"(max-width: 413px)\"><source data-srcset=\"https://a2.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0811%2Fr1700455_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=272&h=153&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=origin, https://a2.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0811%2Fr1700455_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=544&h=306&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=origin&format=jpg 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 414px)\"><img  data-default-src=\"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/0811/r1700455_1296x729_16-9.jpg\"  class=\" lazyload\" data-image-container=\".feed-item-figure\" ></picture></a></div><span class=\"credit\">V.J. Lovero /Sports Illustrated via Getty Images</span></figure></li><li class=\"text-container\" data-id=\"49603685\"><h2><a name=\"&lpos=h