ranking-best-nfl-quarterbacks-top-10-trait-skill-arm-accuracy-rushing\" data-sport=\"null\" data-mptype=\"image\"><picture ><source data-srcset=\"https://a4.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0809%2Fnfl_orlovsky%27s_qb_trait_rankings_16x9.jpg&w=78&h=78&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=center, https://a4.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0809%2Fnfl_orlovsky%27s_qb_trait_rankings_16x9.jpg&w=156&h=156&scale=crop&cquality=40&location=center 2x\" media=\"(max-width: 413px)\"><source data-srcset=\"https://a4.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0809%2Fnfl_orlovsky%27s_qb_trait_rankings_16x9.jpg&w=272&h=153&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=origin, https://a4.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0809%2Fnfl_orlovsky%27s_qb_trait_rankings_16x9.jpg&w=544&h=306&scale=crop&cquality=80&location=origin&format=jpg 2x\" media=\"(min-width: 414px)\"><img  data-default-src=\"https://a.espncdn.com/photo/2026/0809/nfl_orlovsky's_qb_trait_rankings_16x9.jpg\"  class=\" lazyload\" data-image-container=\".feed-item-figure\" ></picture></a></div><span class=\"credit\">ESPN</span></figure></li><li class=\"text-container\" data-id=\"49521144\"><h2><a name=\"&lpos=hp-rightrail:story:49521144:13\" href=\"/nfl/story/_/id/49521144/2026-ranking-best-nfl-quarterbacks-top-10-trait-skill-arm-accuracy-rushing\">Ranking NFL quarterbacks by trait: Best arm, accuracy, more</a></h2><p>Does Josh Allen have the league's strongest arm? Is Lamar Jackson still the most unstoppable QB rusher? And where does Caleb Williams stand among the best improvisers?</p></li><li><figure class=\"feed-item-figure \"><div class=\"img-wrap\"><a name=\"&lpos=hp-rightrail:image:14\" href=\"/nba/story/_/id/49593121/russell-westbrook-retires-nba-legacy-triple-double-records-durant-partnership\" data-sport=\"null\" data-mptype=\"image\"><picture ><source data-srcset=\"https://a.espncdn.com/combiner/i?img=%2Fphoto%2F2026%2F0812%2Fr1700952_2_1296x729_16%2D9.jpg&w=78&h=78&scale=crop&cquality=80&locati